/// V2.0 BCNF tuzatishi: unique kalit (organization_id, period_start, period_end) dan (organization_id, period_start) ga o'zgartirildi, chunki period_start → period_end (oylik davr). Eski kalit bir-biriga kirib ketuvchi davrlarga ruxsat berardi. Overlap taqiqi uchun EXCLUDE gist — SQL ilovaga qarang. V2
model PayrollPeriod {
